# Runtime archive — generated by the live services (claims land per day,
# receipts/observations/digests/reservations churn constantly). Never
# versioned; the ledger's own append-only store + receipts + audit provide
# integrity, not Git.
/storage/**

# Curated, immutable, claim-referenced content stays tracked.
!/storage/evidence/
!/storage/evidence/**
!/storage/FLIGHT-RECORDER-TARGET.md
!/storage/PROVENANCE_AND_FINDINGS.md
